# Cryptid Inspector: "Whenever a face-down permanent you control enters and whenever this creature or another permanent you control is
# turned face up, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." (CR 708.3, 701.40b, 603.2). A 2/3 with vigilance.
#
# Turn 1: Mox Emerald, Mox Jet and Mox Pearl pay for the Inspector, Black Lotus for Hauntwoods Shrieker. Turn 3 the Shrieker attacks and
# manifests dread: Snapcaster Mage enters face down under Bot1's control, so the Inspector gets its first counter (a 3/4). After
# combat the Shrieker's ability ({1}{G}) turns the Mage face up: another permanent Bot1 controls is turned face up, the second counter
# (a 4/5).

